<h2 id="styling">Styling reference</h2>
<h3 id="classes">Classes</h3>
<table>
    <thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>Kind</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table</code></td><td>block</td><td>the wrapper: <code>overflow-x: auto</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__table</code></td><td>element</td><td>the <code>&lt;table&gt;</code>: full width, collapsed borders, a line under each row (none under the last)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>thead th</code></td><td>-</td><td>sticky, muted surface, <code>text-xs</code> uppercase semibold, no wrap</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>tbody th[scope="row"]</code></td><td>-</td><td>semibold row headers</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__cell--check</code></td><td>cell modifier</td><td>a 2.75rem checkbox column</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__cell--actions</code></td><td>cell modifier</td><td>as narrow as its content, end-aligned, no wrap</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__cell--center</code></td><td>cell modifier</td><td>centred</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__cell--lead</code></td><td>cell modifier</td><td>the first cell of a stacked row: shown as the block's heading on phones</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__primary</code></td><td>element</td><td>semibold foreground text (the row's name)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__secondary</code></td><td>element</td><td>a block line below, <code>text-xs</code>, muted</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__empty</code></td><td>element (on <code>tr</code>)</td><td>a padded, centred, muted message row</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__grip</code></td><td>element</td><td>a drag handle: subtle colour, <code>cursor: grab</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table__sort</code></td><td>element</td><td>the sort button <code>dnf.js</code> puts into a <code>th[data-sort]</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table--compact</code></td><td>modifier</td><td>denser cells</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dnf-table--stack</code></td><td>modifier</td><td>below 40rem: no header, each row a block of "label: value" lines (<code>td[data-label]</code>), actions end-aligned</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<p><code>&lt;code&gt;</code> in a table cell does not wrap.</p>

<h3 id="states">States</h3>
<table>
    <thead><tr><th>State</th><th>Selector</th><th>Look</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>selected row</td><td><code>tbody tr[data-selected="true"]</code></td><td><code>--dnf-primary-soft</code> background (set by the collection's selection)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>dragged row</td><td><code>tbody tr[data-dragging="true"]</code></td><td>50% opacity (set by your drag script)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>sorted column</td><td><code>th[aria-sort="ascending"]</code>, <code>th[aria-sort="descending"]</code></td><td>the sort icon in full primary colour; turned over when descending</td></tr>
        <tr><td>hidden row</td><td><code>tr[hidden]</code></td><td>hidden, also in the stacked layout</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3 id="tokens">Tokens</h3>
<p><code>--dnf-table-cell-y</code> and <code>--dnf-table-cell-x</code>: the cell padding (<code>--dnf-space-3</code> /
    <code>--dnf-space-4</code>; <code>--compact</code> sets <code>--dnf-space-2</code> / <code>--dnf-space-3</code>).</p>

<h2 id="api">API</h2>
<p>The table has no tag helper: the classes above are its API. Rows become interactive with the collection hooks of
    <code>dnf.js</code> (<a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/behaviours">Behaviours</a>); the
    <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/toolbar">toolbar</a> and the
    <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/pagination">pagination</a> pages cover the bars around the table.</p>
<table>
    <thead><tr><th>Hook</th><th>On</th><th>Behaviour</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>data-collection</code></td><td>the card (the scope)</td><td>every <code>[data-item]</code> inside is an item; <code>data-page-size="N"</code> turns on paging</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-item</code></td><td><code>tr</code></td><td>an item; <code>data-search</code> replaces its text for the search, <code>data-&lt;key&gt;</code> holds its filter values</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-sort="text|number|date"</code></td><td><code>th</code></td><td>becomes a <code>dnf-table__sort</code> button; a click sorts the first <code>tbody</code> by the column (the cell's <code>data-sort-value</code>, else its text) and sets <code>aria-sort</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-select-all</code></td><td>header checkbox</td><td>checks every visible item; shows checked or indeterminate</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-select-item</code></td><td>row checkbox</td><td>its row gets <code>data-selected="true"</code>; shows the bulk bar</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-collection-empty</code></td><td>a <code>dnf-table__empty</code> row</td><td>shown when nothing matches the search and filters</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2 id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<ul>
    <li>A real <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;th&gt;</code> headers (<code>scope="row"</code> for row headers); a caption or the card's heading names it.</li>
    <li>With <code>--stack</code>, give every cell but the lead one a <code>data-label</code> - it replaces the hidden header on phones.</li>
    <li>Checkboxes and icon-only buttons in rows need names that include the row: "Select Home", "Actions for Home".</li>
    <li>A column without a visible header (actions, checkboxes) still gets one for screen readers: <code>&lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Actions&lt;/span&gt;</code>.</li>
    <li>Sortable headers become buttons; <code>aria-sort</code> tells the current order.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="guidelines">Guidelines</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Do put the table straight into a card, with a <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/toolbar">toolbar</a> above and a <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/pagination">pagination</a> below.</li>
    <li>Do show "nothing yet" with an <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/empty-state">empty state</a> and "no match" with a <code>data-collection-empty</code> row.</li>
    <li>Do keep the row's actions in one dropdown in the last column.</li>
    <li>Don't use a table for layout, or for a single record's details - use a <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/description-list">description list</a>.</li>
</ul>
